type: dataset
title: "ANHQV × The Sims 2 Preservation Project"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-07-26
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
authors:
  - name: "lcd97"
  - name: "Archivo 21"
abstract: >-
  The ANHQV-TS2 preservation, reconstruction, and research repository for the world of
  Aquí no hay quien viva, using The Sims 2 as an interactive medium and
  experimental laboratory. The repository documents ANHQV sources,
  reconstruction decisions, Sims 2 engine behaviour, controlled experiments,
  contributor governance, and preservation methods.
keywords:
  - "Aquí no hay quien viva"
  - "ANHQV"
  - "ANHQV-TS2"
  - "Aquí Sims Hay Quien Viva"
  - "The Sims 2"
  - "digital preservation"
  - "fan studies"
  - "game research"
  - "simulation"
  - "reproducible research"
